WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.204 --> 00:00:04.125
"And here she is, the birthday girl, Allyzooba!"

2
00:00:04.145 --> 00:00:04.726
the DJ announced.

3
00:00:30.112 --> 00:00:32.813
The crowd cheered as Ally entered the large ballroom.

4
00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:37.574
"Thank you all for coming to my party!"

5
00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:40.835
She twirled around, showing off her new outfit.

6
00:00:41.655 --> 00:00:43.336
"Happy birthday!"

7
00:00:43.836 --> 00:00:44.596
everyone cried.

8
00:00:44.916 --> 00:00:48.718
But from somewhere in the back of the room, a voice called, "Allyzooba!"

9
00:00:49.498 --> 00:00:50.518
Ally kept twirling.

10
00:00:51.158 --> 00:00:53.499
"Allyzooba!" the voice said more sharply.

11
00:00:53.999 --> 00:00:56.780
Ally's eyes flew open, abruptly ending her daydream.

12
00:00:58.512 --> 00:01:01.013
"Allyzooba Delta5X of Astralia!"

13
00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:03.474
her father called from the main control room.

14
00:01:04.014 --> 00:01:08.336
Her family's spaceship was docked on planet Dorpio10 for her parents' latest peace mission.

15
00:01:09.837 --> 00:01:13.198
As Astralians with Astral minds, they flew all over the universe.

16
00:01:14.239 --> 00:01:19.361
They solved major problems like severe droughts, food shortages, even wars between galaxies.

17
00:01:19.381 --> 00:01:22.962
"We're back," Ally's dad called.

18
00:01:22.982 --> 00:01:27.184
"Our mission was a success, so we'll be taking off for home soon."

19
00:01:28.108 --> 00:01:29.929
"Okay!" Ally called back.

20
00:01:30.489 --> 00:01:33.671
She threw her voice so it would sound as if it were coming from another part of the

21
00:01:33.711 --> 00:01:37.092
ship. "I'm just finishing up my homework!"

22
00:01:38.333 --> 00:01:40.894
Ally picked up her tablet and continued planning her party.

23
00:01:40.914 --> 00:01:45.316
"Dad won't come looking for me if he thinks I'm doing homework," she thought.

24
00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:48.937
But seconds later her father burst into her sleep quarters.

25
00:01:48.957 --> 00:01:51.559
"Homework, huh?"

26
00:01:52.619 --> 00:01:54.100
Dad took Ally's tablet from her.

27
00:01:56.552 --> 00:01:58.153
"You should watch what you think, daughter.

28
00:01:58.593 --> 00:02:01.173
You're not the only Astralian who can read minds."

29
00:02:02.214 --> 00:02:02.874
Ally sighed.

30
00:02:02.894 --> 00:02:06.775
"I was hoping you were too far away."

31
00:02:06.795 --> 00:02:10.296
"I was close enough for you to throw your voice to trick me.

32
00:02:11.377 --> 00:02:13.237
So I was close enough to read your mind."

33
00:02:14.618 --> 00:02:16.918
He sat beside her, his expression softening.

34
00:02:16.938 --> 00:02:22.340
"Mom and I are happy that you've mastered throwing your voice, and your levitation skills are improving.

35
00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:26.702
But you're past the age when most Astralians start going on solo missions.

36
00:02:27.162 --> 00:02:29.203
You need to focus on your studies to prepare."

37
00:02:30.243 --> 00:02:30.903
Ally nodded.

38
00:02:30.923 --> 00:02:35.065
"Okay. Can I have my tablet back now?"

39
00:02:39.127 --> 00:02:39.867
"I'm afraid not.

40
00:02:40.447 --> 00:02:45.989
Our Astral minds are revered all over the universe because we use them to help others, not plan

41
00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:51.191
parties." "But parties make people happy, Dad!

42
00:02:51.491 --> 00:02:52.552
Doesn't that count?"

43
00:02:53.352 --> 00:02:56.935
"Not as much as keeping the universe in peaceful balance," Dad said.

44
00:02:56.955 --> 00:02:59.177
"Your mother and I have made up our minds.

45
00:02:59.637 --> 00:03:01.459
It's time for you to be more responsible."

46
00:03:01.479 --> 00:03:04.541
"Fine." Ally sighed.

47
00:03:04.561 --> 00:03:07.644
"Send me to planet GrayZone.

48
00:03:08.164 --> 00:03:12.148
I can teach those dull GrayZoners to be more colorful, like me!"

49
00:03:13.609 --> 00:03:14.730
Ally's mom joined them.

50
00:03:15.531 --> 00:03:17.632
"We're going to start with a simpler task.

51
00:03:18.413 --> 00:03:21.676
The communication device in escape pod Alpha needs repair.

52
00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:25.846
Fixing it is a skill you'll need when you start going on solo missions."

53
00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:31.388
Escape pods were kept on Astralians' mother ships in case things got dangerous and a quick getaway was

54
00:03:31.428 --> 00:03:33.529
required. Ally moaned.

55
00:03:33.549 --> 00:03:36.770
"Repairs are boring."

56
00:03:37.771 --> 00:03:39.632
Mom folded her arms and stared at her.

57
00:03:40.432 --> 00:03:43.593
Ally didn't need to read her mind to know she would never win this argument.

58
00:03:43.613 --> 00:03:47.435
"Fine. I'll fix the comm device."

59
00:03:48.735 --> 00:03:49.836
She walked to her closet.

60
00:03:52.204 --> 00:03:54.846
"I'll change out of my pajamas and then get started."

61
00:03:58.549 --> 00:04:01.591
A few minutes later, Ally emerged in a brightly colored outfit.

62
00:04:03.212 --> 00:04:06.614
She wore her favorite boots, which made her feet look especially big.

63
00:04:06.634 --> 00:04:09.736
"That's your idea of work clothes?"

64
00:04:10.237 --> 00:04:11.177
Ally's mother asked.

65
00:04:11.998 --> 00:04:12.939
Ally twirled around.

66
00:04:12.959 --> 00:04:15.941
"Isn't this a cute outfit?"

67
00:04:16.541 --> 00:04:17.462
Her mother sighed.

68
00:04:17.482 --> 00:04:20.324
"It's not very practical."

69
00:04:21.488 --> 00:04:28.554
"It's fine for you to wear a boring old uniform, Mom, but I have to express my personality.

70
00:04:28.954 --> 00:04:30.336
It's what I'm known for!"

71
00:04:30.356 --> 00:04:36.240
"We want you to be known for doing good works throughout the universe," Mom said.

72
00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:39.843
"When we were your age, we had already been on solo missions."

73
00:04:43.086 --> 00:04:44.187
She held out a tablet.

74
00:04:44.687 --> 00:04:46.849
"Here's the manual for fixing the comm device.

75
00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:49.652
Take a look and let me know if you have any questions."

76
00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:52.642
Ally pretended to read through it for a moment.

77
00:04:52.662 --> 00:04:54.824
"It seems simple enough."

78
00:04:55.484 --> 00:04:56.325
Mom frowned.

79
00:04:56.345 --> 00:04:58.066
"You know how to check the meters?

80
00:04:58.527 --> 00:05:02.590
And make sure you unplug the—" "I know all that stuff!"

81
00:05:03.171 --> 00:05:05.252
Ally rolled her eyes and flipped her tentacles.

82
00:05:05.272 --> 00:05:07.194
"See you later."

83
00:05:10.737 --> 00:05:14.680
As she walked to the area on the ship where the pods were stored, Ally forced herself to

84
00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:15.541
think about homework.

85
00:05:16.402 --> 00:05:18.884
She didn't want her parents detecting her real thoughts right now.

86
00:05:20.076 --> 00:05:23.338
But as soon as she was out of range, those thoughts came spilling out.
